id: take-a-breather
name: Take a Breather
# "These Adventuring Maneuvers are possessed by all Characters."
universal: true
prerequisite: N/A
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 1 Hour
# "Regain Life and Ki Points equal to 1/10th of their respective maximums."
regainShare: 10
source: Core Rule
description: >
  An hour's pause, once an Adventuring Session: a tenth of your Life and Ki Points back.
text: >
  Take a Breather: You take the time to regain some stamina.
  –Prerequisite: N/A
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 1 Hour
  –Effect: Regain Life and Ki Points equal to 1/10th of their respective maximums.

---

# Used from the Adventure tab, outside a Combat Encounter: the use counts at once (it was
# attempted), and the card's button gives the Life and Ki Points once the table says the full
# Time Cost was spent. Interrupted, the button is never pressed.
